    skos:prefLabel 'acoustic doppler current profiler (ADCP) vertical beam'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A vertical beam (sometimes referred to as "5th beam" on 5-beam ADCP designs) measuring the distance to the surface using the echo from short pulses and simple peak estimation algorithms. It is used to estimate wave height and amplitude.'@en ;
